OL,3,AJulie Hesmondhalgh left Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors 'with head held high'
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Julie Hesmondhalgh - the most
OL,7,Frecently banished contestant from The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors - says she left the
OL,9,Fshow with her "head held high".
OL,11,FThe former Coronation Street star, from
OL,12,FAccrington in Lancashire, starred as a
OL,13,Ffaithful contestant in the second
OL,14,Fseries of the BBC One show - before
OL,15,Fbeing voted out by other players on
OL,16,FFriday's episode.
OL,18,FShe said she "had no idea" she was
OL,19,Fgoing to be banished, but it "became
OL,20,Fclear it was going to be me and I was a
OL,21,Fbit worried".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
